          "en": "With her went her disciples, women who had learned her dark arts. The old text even gives their names."
        },
        {
          "es": "Allí Calon Arang le rezó a Durga, la diosa feroz que reina en el cementerio.",
          "en": "There Calon Arang prayed to Durga, the fierce goddess who rules the graveyard."
        },
        {
          "es": "Le pidió el poder de traer una peste sobre el reino.",
          "en": "She asked for the power to bring a plague upon the kingdom."
