      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En su palacio, el rey Airlangga se enteró de la terrible noticia.",
          "en": "In his palace, King Airlangga heard the terrible news."
        },
        {
          "es": "Airlangga fue un rey real, que gobernó el este de Java en el siglo once.",
          "en": "Airlangga was a real king, who ruled East Java in the eleventh century."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y tenía raíces balinesas: su padre era Udayana, un rey de Bali.",
          "en": "And he had Balinese roots: his father was Udayana, a king of Bali."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se lo recuerda como un gobernante sabio, que construyó diques para proteger a los campesinos de su valle.",
          "en": "He is remembered as a wise ruler, who built dams to protect the farmers of his river valley."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mandó a sus soldados a Girah, para detener a la viuda de una vez por todas.",
          "en": "He sent his soldiers to Girah, to stop the widow once and for all."
        }
